{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34452","headline":"和袭美题支山南峰僧次韵 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和袭美题支山南峰僧次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"眉毫霜细欲垂肩，自说初栖海岳年。\n万壑烟霞秋後到，一林风雨夜深禅。\n时翻贝叶添新藏，间插松枝护小泉。\n好是清冬无外事，匡林斋罢向阳眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34452.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34452","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}